WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
[Phone ringing]

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.200
Your hands are full. The phone still rings.

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.350
[Second phone ring; connection chime]

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.300
The second ring. That’s where BotBound begins.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.600
BotBound answers.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.900
On-brand. On the second ring. Ready to help.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:08.100
“Thanks for calling. How can I help?”

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:08.600
Configured example.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.800
Listen. Decide. Act.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.300
Capture intent. Follow your rules. Move to the next step.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.600
BotBound. You can't answer every call. Your Bot can.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:14.900
botbound.app
